VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t05
GOAL
  bump applies percent increase correctly.
CLAIM bump-basic REQUIRED
  ENSURE bump(100,10) == 110
CLAIM bump-floor REQUIRED
  ENSURE bump(99,50) == 148
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY bump-basic
  USING mini.t.bump.basic
VERIFY bump-floor
  USING mini.t.bump.floor
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
